# Temperature changes the rate constant; finite-time yields also reflect depletion
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL @ 25C
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.79g @ 25C
add v1 HCl 0.002mol @ 25C
new
add v2 water 100mL @ 35C
add v2 Na2S2O3 0.79g @ 35C
add v2 HCl 0.002mol @ 35C
new
add v3 water 100mL @ 45C
add v3 Na2S2O3 0.79g @ 45C
add v3 HCl 0.002mol @ 45C
new
add v4 water 100mL @ 55C
add v4 Na2S2O3 0.79g @ 55C
add v4 HCl 0.002mol @ 55C
wait 10s
inspect
